Subject: [PATCH] Keep MCP diagnostics free of API response bodies

C1 may echo submitted credentials in validation errors. Report status and
operation context while preserving recovery guidance and known IDs.

diff --git a/internal/provider/mcp_server_resource.go b/internal/provider/mcp_server_resource.go
